<title>GERMANY: Hoechst 9 month pre-tax profit almost 5.7 bln DM.</title>
<headline>Hoechst 9 month pre-tax profit almost 5.7 bln DM.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>German chemical group Hoechst AG said on Wednesday that group nine month pre-tax profit climbed to nearly 5.7 billion marks including gains, compared with 3.43 billion marks the company reported a year ago.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement that group operating sales declined about two percent to 38.4 billion marks and that group operating profit was almost 4.1 billion marks.</p>
<p>Hoechst added that nine month underlying pre-tax profit rose by one percent.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
